{"book": "workbook", "page": 56, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "rows": [{"text": "二、汉字", "confidence": 0.99744, "box": [[0.13109, 0.08907], [0.26134, 0.08907], [0.26134, 0.1152], [0.13109, 0.1152]]}, {"text": "ChineseCharacters", "confidence": 0.99591, "box": [[0.28235, 0.09857], [0.44706, 0.09976], [0.44622, 0.11698], [0.28235, 0.1158]]}, {"text": "汉字书写（一）Chinese Character Writing(I)", "confidence": 0.95922, "box": [[0.29832, 0.14727], [0.7042, 0.14846], [0.7042, 0.16627], [0.29832, 0.16508]]}, {"text": "汉字结构简介Introductionto theStructureof ChineseCharacters", "confidence": 0.97553, "box": [[0.14958, 0.19181], [0.71681, 0.19299], [0.71681, 0.21081], [0.14958, 0.20903]]}, {"text": "汉字是记录汉语的符号，一个汉字基本由形、音、义构成，所以，汉字也被称为表", "confidence": 0.99831, "box": [[0.19328, 0.22268], [0.88319, 0.22268], [0.88319, 0.23634], [0.19328, 0.23634]]}, {"text": "意文字或意音文字。", "confidence": 0.99946, "box": [[0.15378, 0.24703], [0.31933, 0.24703], [0.31933, 0.26247], [0.15378, 0.26247]]}, {"text": "汉字结构主要包括笔画、部件和整字。一般来说，笔画构成部件，部件构成整字。", "confidence": 0.99895, "box": [[0.19244, 0.27257], [0.87143, 0.27257], [0.87143, 0.288], [0.19244, 0.288]]}, {"text": "笔画是构成汉字字形特定的点和线，是汉字的最小结构单位。汉字的常用笔画有", "confidence": 0.9991, "box": [[0.19076, 0.29632], [0.88235, 0.2981], [0.88235, 0.31354], [0.19076, 0.31176]]}, {"text": "横、竖、撇、捺、点、提、折、钩。", "confidence": 0.98398, "box": [[0.15294, 0.32185], [0.45378, 0.32304], [0.45378, 0.33848], [0.15294, 0.33729]]}, {"text": "部件由笔画组成，有的部件能够独立成字，有的不能成字，需与其他部件组成一个", "confidence": 0.99917, "box": [[0.19244, 0.34739], [0.88151, 0.34857], [0.88151, 0.36401], [0.19244, 0.36283]]}, {"text": "整字。", "confidence": 0.99995, "box": [[0.15294, 0.37292], [0.20756, 0.37292], [0.20756, 0.38895], [0.15294, 0.38895]]}, {"text": "整字由部件组成。整字结构有两种：一种叫独体字，由一个部件组成；另一种叫合", "confidence": 0.99902, "box": [[0.1916, 0.39727], [0.88151, 0.39846], [0.88151, 0.4139], [0.1916, 0.41271]]}, {"text": "体字，由两个或两个以上的部件组成。", "confidence": 0.99902, "box": [[0.15546, 0.42458], [0.47311, 0.42458], [0.47311, 0.43824], [0.15546, 0.43824]]}, {"text": "汉字笔画是有书写顺序的，称为笔顺。", "confidence": 0.99597, "box": [[0.19328, 0.45012], [0.51092, 0.45012], [0.51092, 0.46318], [0.19328, 0.46318]]}, {"text": "Chinese characters are thewritten symbols used torecord the Chinese language.Each", "confidence": 0.96651, "box": [[0.19244, 0.48515], [0.88235, 0.48575], [0.88235, 0.50178], [0.19244, 0.50119]]}, {"text": "character is composed of form, pronunciation, and meaning, which is why Chinese characters", "confidence": 0.9748, "box": [[0.15462, 0.5095], [0.88319, 0.51128], [0.88319, 0.5285], [0.15462, 0.52672]]}, {"text": "areoftendescribed assemanticscriptorsemantophoneticscript.", "confidence": 0.98913, "box": [[0.15378, 0.53563], [0.6521, 0.538], [0.6521, 0.55285], [0.15378, 0.55048]]}, {"text": "The structure of a Chinese character generally includes strokes, components, and the", "confidence": 0.98798, "box": [[0.19076, 0.55998], [0.88319, 0.56057], [0.88319, 0.57838], [0.19076, 0.57779]]}, {"text": "complete character. Generally, strokes form components, and components form complete", "confidence": 0.98725, "box": [[0.15462, 0.58551], [0.88151, 0.5861], [0.88151, 0.60392], [0.15462, 0.60333]]}, {"text": "characters.", "confidence": 0.99909, "box": [[0.15294, 0.60986], [0.23697, 0.61164], [0.23613, 0.62827], [0.15294, 0.62648]]}, {"text": "Strokes are specific dots and lines that make up the shape of a character. They are the", "confidence": 0.98671, "box": [[0.19076, 0.63599], [0.88319, 0.63658], [0.88319, 0.65439], [0.19076, 0.6538]]}, {"text": "smallest structural units of Chinese writing. The commonly used strokes include horizontal (横),", "confidence": 0.98611, "box": [[0.15462, 0.66211], [0.88235, 0.66211], [0.88235, 0.67933], [0.15462, 0.67933]]}, {"text": "vertical (竖), left-falling (撒),right-falling (捺),dot (点),rising (提),turning (折),and hook(钩).", "confidence": 0.94217, "box": [[0.15462, 0.68587], [0.87815, 0.68705], [0.87815, 0.70487], [0.15462, 0.70368]]}, {"text": "Components are made up of strokes. Some components can stand alone as independent", "confidence": 0.98395, "box": [[0.19244, 0.71259], [0.88319, 0.71259], [0.88319, 0.72981], [0.19244, 0.72981]]}, {"text": "characters, while others cannot and must combine with other components to form a complete", "confidence": 0.9835, "box": [[0.15546, 0.73812], [0.88151, 0.73812], [0.88151, 0.75594], [0.15546, 0.75594]]}, {"text": "character.", "confidence": 0.99893, "box": [[0.15462, 0.76306], [0.23109, 0.76485], [0.23025, 0.78088], [0.15378, 0.7785]]}, {"text": "Complete characters consist of one or more components. Structurally,there are two main", "confidence": 0.98073, "box": [[0.19328, 0.78979], [0.88487, 0.78979], [0.88487, 0.80641], [0.19328, 0.80641]]}, {"text": "typesofcharacters:", "confidence": 0.99493, "box": [[0.15546, 0.81532], [0.30504, 0.81532], [0.30504, 0.83135], [0.15546, 0.83135]]}, {"text": "Compound characters(合体字)—formed bytwo or more components.", "confidence": 0.95979, "box": [[0.19328, 0.8658], [0.73193, 0.8658], [0.73193, 0.88242], [0.19328, 0.88242]]}, {"text": "The writing of Chinese characters follows specific stroke order rules,known as“笔顺", "confidence": 0.98467, "box": [[0.19244, 0.89014], [0.88403, 0.88895], [0.88403, 0.90677], [0.19244, 0.90796]]}, {"text": "(bishun)\".", "confidence": 0.99055, "box": [[0.15546, 0.91686], [0.23697, 0.91686], [0.23697, 0.93349], [0.15546, 0.93349]]}, {"text": "049", "confidence": 0.99926, "box": [[0.89748, 0.95071], [0.93445, 0.95071], [0.93445, 0.96556], [0.89748, 0.96556]]}]}